WEBVTT

00:03:28.375 --> 00:03:31.678
What is he saying? I can't hear you!

00:03:31.678 --> 00:03:34.557
I can't hear you
through the glass, honey!

00:03:34.557 --> 00:03:37.320
There you are in my ear.

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:39.920
Oh, you can hear me?

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:41.778
The whole time.

00:03:41.778 --> 00:03:44.864
Oh, yes, I am a little chilly.

00:03:45.980 --> 00:03:51.553
Yes, oh the cold is for the machines,
the new technology. Okay.

00:03:51.553 --> 00:03:57.304
Yes, now remind me again, you're recording
not only my voice but my feelings

00:03:57.304 --> 00:03:59.604
and my memories? Right.